  ["Who may invest", ["Many private offerings are limited to accredited investors. Under SEC rules, individuals generally qualify with income over $200,000 ($300,000 with a spouse or spousal equivalent) in each of the last two years, or net worth over $1 million excluding a primary residence, or with certain professional licenses. These limits exist because the risks are high and disclosures are fewer."]],
