  ["Family meetings", ["Regular family meetings, with an agenda and age-appropriate participation, build communication and trust. Topics can include the family's values, philanthropy, education, and, as heirs mature, the family's assets and plans."]],
  ["Preparing heirs", ["Teach financial skills at every age: earning, saving, giving, and investing. Give responsibility gradually. Many families use staged distributions, mentoring, and family philanthropy to prepare the next generation."]],
