 cons=["Requires time and commitment", "Hard conversations are part of it", "Family dynamics can be complex", "Structures need updating over time"],
 watch=["Include family members with care and age-appropriate information.", "Consider a neutral facilitator for difficult conversations.", "Keep documents and plans consistent with your governance.", "Protect privacy; not every detail must be shared."],
